  "title": "TE Connectivity survey: Return on investment becomes top priority as AI age evolves",
  "summary": "Adoption rates of artificial intelligence tools at industrial technology companies have exceeded 80%, according to a new global survey from TE Connectivity, a world leader in connectors and sensors. And now, the survey data says, these companies are demanding a return on their investments as AI tools become more integrated into their operations. For the first time in the four years TE has published the Industrial Technology Index to understand from engineers and business leaders what is driving",
